# Force source and documentation to be treated as text.
#
# A stray control byte in a source file makes Git classify it as binary, and
# every diff then renders as "Binary files differ" — which hides the file from
# review entirely. That is how a defect in a test's own logic can survive to a
# commit unnoticed.
*.ts text
*.mts text
*.cts text
*.tsx text
*.js text
*.mjs text
*.cjs text
*.json text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
